      "source_xml_line": 186,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_61",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "So, what can I give you that's interesting... Yeah, I remember. Here's the deal: at Yantar, there are these old \"shell garages\" on the approach to the factory. Search between them, you'll find something.",
      "JA_current": "さて、どんな面白いネタをくれてやろうか……そうだ、思い出したぞ。いいか、ヤンターの工場へ通じる道沿いに、古いかまぼこ型の簡易車庫が並んでいる。その隙間を探ってみな、お宝に巡り合えるはずだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "shaman_shron3_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "4",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
